      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I also had this happening previously (But cant test due to another issue specific to my GPU)\n\nIf I remember right, you have to power cycle the headset a few times to get the audio crash to happen.  Sometimes it never happens, sometimes it happens on one power cycle.  Very strange irregular behavior.  \n\nOnce it happens it can only be fixed by rebooting VRChat, steamVR does not have to be restarted.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
